WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Thomani thanngini. I vhulunga maḓi a u sheledza zwimela.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Maḓi a bva thanngini. Tshisefi tshi fara muṱavha.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Tevhelani maḓi musi a tshi elela nga ngomu ha phaiphi tsini na zwimela.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Fhasi ha tshifukedzi, maḓi a rotha zwiṱuku-zwiṱuku a tshi bva kha tshibvisa-matonsi.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Maḓi a dzhena mavuni. Sedzani musi a tshi phaḓalala u mona na midzi.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Maḓi a bva thanngini, a fhira nga phaiphi a swika midzini. Nḓila i dzula yo oma.
